1
00:00:00,302 --> 00:00:01,532
(Penny:)Okay, it won't
be that bad.

2
00:00:01,604 --> 00:00:03,114
(Penny:)We wouldn't even sit in
your spot while you're gone.

3
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:04,708
(Sheldon:)You're darn right, you wouldn't.

4
00:00:04,773 --> 00:00:07,113
(Sheldon:)No matter where I am,
this will always be my spot.

5
00:00:07,176 --> 00:00:08,246
(Sheldon:)Like an embassy

6
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:09,510
(Sheldon:)in a foreign country,

7
00:00:09,578 --> 00:00:12,648
(Sheldon:)this seat is the sovereign
soil of my bottom.

8
00:00:12,715 --> 00:00:15,715
(Leonard:)Just nod and smile.
He's almost gone.

9
00:00:17,386 --> 00:00:19,826
(Amy:)Sheldon, what do you think?

10
00:00:22,458 --> 00:00:23,988
(Sheldon:)Very well. I'm on board.

11
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:25,429
- Seriously?
- Yes.

12
00:00:25,494 --> 00:00:26,864
(Sheldon:)I accept this
five-week mission

13
00:00:26,929 --> 00:00:28,999
(Sheldon:)to share a living space
with my girlfriend.

14
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:30,464
(Amy:)Oh. This is so exciting.

15
00:00:30,533 --> 00:00:32,703
(Sheldon:)Well, now, don't be surprised
if, like Star Trek,

16
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:35,608
it's canceled in three.

17
00:00:36,772 --> 00:00:40,442
(Raj:)I have to say, I am happy
with your ob-gyn.

18
00:00:41,777 --> 00:00:44,877
Cool. 'Cause she says
you're doing a great job as

19
00:00:44,947 --> 00:00:48,017
"weird friend who doesn't have
to be at every appointment."

20
00:00:48,083 --> 00:00:50,523
I'm the son of a gynecologist.
I could be helpful.

21
00:00:50,586 --> 00:00:51,816
(Bernadette:)It would help

22
00:00:51,887 --> 00:00:55,627
(Bernadette:)if you stopped telling me
I have a textbook cervix.

23
00:00:55,691 --> 00:01:01,021
(Raj:)The polite response is,
"Thank you for noticing."

